        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jordan Mark Witzigreuter\n- Roles: American singer-songwriter\n- Projects: The Ready Set\n- Products: I'm Alive, I'm Dreaming; Free Money\n- Organizations: Cell; Penetration\n- Places: Fort Wayne, Indiana; New York\n- Concepts: Grunge; college rock; alternative\n\nFacts:\n- Jordan Mark Witzigreuter was born on November 14, 1989.\n- Jordan Mark Witzigreuter is professionally known as The Ready Set.\n- Jordan Mark Witzigreuter is an American singer-songwriter from Fort Wayne, Indiana.\n- Cell were a New York-based band.\n- Cell were often labeled grunge because of the era in which they existed, although college rock or alternative may describe them more accurately.\n- Penetration covered the song \"Free Money\" on the album \"Moving Targets.\"\n- Cell later covered \"Free Money\" as a B-side.\n- \"I'm Alive, I'm Dreaming\" is the second studio album by American electropop singer-songwriter The Ready Set.",
